  "description": "Differential sweep corpus for applyOverlay's JSONPath engine. The TS uses jsonpath-plus (NOT RFC 9535); the Rust port uses serde_json_path (RFC 9535). Every `target` below is run through BOTH and the matched normalized paths are diffed. Fixtures alone are not sufficient evidence that the engines agree \u2014 this is.",
